source: crates/hydronode-cli/tests/c3_help.rs
expression: text
---
Open the dashboard, a sensor or another page of the profile's server.
WHAT: a sensor id, or dashboard, devices, messages, stations, docs.

Usage: hn open [OPTIONS] [WHAT]

Arguments:
  [WHAT]  Sensor id or page: dashboard, devices, messages, stations, docs

Options:
      --print  Only print the link
  -h, --help   Print help

Global options:
  -p, --profile <NAME>  Profile to use (server and login), see 'hn profile list'
      --json            Print JSON instead of tables (stable shape, for scripts)

Examples:
  hn open
  hn open <sensor-id>
  hn open messages --print
